# Application lockfiles are intentionally versioned for this app.
# Keep `pubspec.lock`, `ios/Podfile`, and `ios/Podfile.lock` committed.
# Shared native project settings such as Xcode project/workspace files,
# Gradle files, manifests, and versioned xcconfig files should stay committed.

